        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note" value="HTTP request order (http.rs): authenticate (Authorization header,&lt;br&gt;then Origin), start the 3 s deadline, take an admission slot, match&lt;br&gt;the catalog route, refuse an operation the access does not advertise,&lt;br&gt;read the body (1 MiB cap), run the Store operation, answer&lt;br&gt;{data, meta} with an ETag, or a typed failure. The CLI skips HTTP:&lt;br&gt;invoke_resource matches the same routes in process." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1a1a1a;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1195" y="775" width="590" height="110" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
